{"id":"570349aa538831d0","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md","title":"Canonical Model for GL","display":"thm-canonical-model-gl — Canonical Model for GL","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-canonical-model-gl","aliases":["89-thm-canonical-model-gl"],"display":"thm-canonical-model-gl — Canonical Model for GL","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-lem-gl-canonical-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-canonical-model-gl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-canonical-model-gl</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonical-model-gl — Canonical Model for GL"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6f068c38418e21f2\" href=\"?note=6f068c38418e21f2\" title=\"89-df-gl-canonical-model\">89-df-gl-canonical-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"70714818ed137ea4\" href=\"?note=70714818ed137ea4\" title=\"89-lem-gl-canonical-truth\">89-lem-gl-canonical-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\">\\(\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})\\)</span> is the canonical model of GL.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\forall S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A\n\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\forall S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A\n\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> : GL典范模型 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a>)</li>\n<li>典范模型恰好验证GL定理</li>\n<li>典范模型方法的成功应用</li>\n<li>完备性证明的核心工具</li>\n<li>右到左使用真值引理与每个典范世界包含 GL；左到右还使用非定理可\n扩张为含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\">\\(\\neg A\\)</span> 的极大 GL-一致集。结论不要求典范框架本身逆良基。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-canonical-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-canonical-truth","status":"resolved","id":"70714818ed137ea4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-canonical-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ : GL典范模型 (see [[89-df-canonical-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}=(W_{\\mathrm{GL}},R_{\\mathrm{GL}},V_{\\mathrm{GL}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model\\text{-}gl}\\vdash\n\\left(\n\\forall S\\in W_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\;\n\\mathcal{M}^{\\mathrm{can}}_{\\mathrm{GL}},S\\models A\n\\right)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A","display":false}],"bytes":1233,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md]]\n[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-fmp-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidability.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidable.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness.md]]\n[[89-thm-g